    "title": "Florida Man Set to be Executed for 1992 Stabbing Death",
    "text": "• A Florida man convicted of fatally stabbing his wife decades ago is set to be executed Thursday evening.\n• Dusty Ray Spencer, 74, is scheduled to receive a three-drug injection starting at 6 p.m. at Florida State Prison near Starke for the 1992 stabbing death of his wife Karen.\n• The execution is scheduled to take place on Thursday evening.\n• Spencer was convicted of the crime in 1993 and has been on death row since then.\n• The Florida Department of Corrections has confirmed the execution date.\n• Spencer's lawyers have not commented on the upcoming execution.\n• The case has been the subject of much controversy over the years.\n• The execution will be the 24th in Florida this year.\n• The death penalty is a highly debated topic in the United States.",
